I just updated to 3.1.1 and realized, that saving a game and returning to
it just does not work anymore :-(

On saving the game a save file is stored in the save directory. This file
has the ending .Z, as I wanted compressed save games.

Restarting the game does not search for .Z files any more. In order to
reload a save game, you have to manually uncompress the file.
Now the game shows:

	restoring game...	(Aaah! its found again!)
	sh xxxxx.Z not found	(hmm, just want to uncompress it twice???)

and the saved game is loaded and can be played again.

Seems that the DEV team messed something up within the restore routine, as
it now seems to search for the wrong filename :-(((

I now will recompile with compression disabled....

